OL,3,GNEWSA'Utterly surreal' deer case leaves
OL,4,Adriver baffled
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who faced criminal charges for
OL,7,Fpicking a dead deer up off a road says
OL,8,Fhe found the experience "utterly
OL,9,Fsurreal".
OL,11,FGuy Carpenter, 42, from Dalton, near
OL,12,FThirsk, North Yorkshire, found the
OL,13,Fanimal on the A66 near Barnard Castle,
OL,14,FCounty Durham, on 7 June this year.
OL,16,FAs he was picking the carcass up, he
OL,17,Fwas stopped by passing police officers
OL,18,Fwho told him he was breaking the law.
OL,19,FHe was later charged under the Deer Act
OL,20,Fand taken to court.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
