OL,3,GNEWSA'Utterly surreal' deer case leaves
OL,4,Adriver baffled
OL,5,
OL,6,FDurham Police said it had withdrawn
OL,7,Fproceedings against Carpenter after a
OL,8,Freview, because it accepted he "had a
OL,9,Fgenuinely-held belief that he was
OL,10,Fallowed to remove the animal".
